#. module: purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost.res_config_settings_view_form
msgid ""
"Lowering a confirmed order line reduces its open receipt even when the "
"converted cost changed since confirmation, instead of creating a return"
msgstr ""
"Baisser la quantité d'une ligne confirmée réduit sa réception ouverte même "
"si le coût converti a changé depuis la confirmation, au lieu de créer un "
"retour"

#. module: purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost.field_res_company__purchase_decrease_ignore_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost.field_res_config_settings__purchase_decrease_ignore_cost
msgid "Reduce Receipts Regardless of Cost"
msgstr "Réduire les réceptions quel que soit le coût"

#. module: purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost
#: model:ir.model,name:purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost.model_stock_move
msgid "Stock Move"
msgstr "Mouvement de stock"

#. module: purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost.field_res_company__purchase_decrease_ignore_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_stock_decrease_ignore_cost.field_res_config_settings__purchase_decrease_ignore_cost
msgid ""
"When the quantity of a confirmed purchase order line is lowered, reduce its "
"open receipt even if the cost converted to the company currency has changed "
"since the order was confirmed (for instance after a new exchange rate was "
"loaded), instead of creating a return."
msgstr ""
"Lorsque la quantité d'une ligne de bon de commande confirmée est baissée, "
"réduire sa réception ouverte même si le coût converti dans la devise de la "
"société a changé depuis la confirmation de la commande (par exemple après le"
" chargement d'un nouveau taux de change), au lieu de créer un retour."
